{
	"title": "a node is named to a reader by the path it has now, up its names (places' namesOf, the latest placed first), never a record of where it once was [the dormouse's findings 12, 13]: a handle in a call's args shown as its path through a folder above renamed, a second name placed later, that name taken out, a name given through a readChildren handle (by id)",
	"steps": [
